  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, prioritizing forward exploration and random_walk in clear states, using short directed turns for obstacle recovery, and reserving move_backward and full_rotate for rare, last-resort recovery. The design ensures that after any obstacle, the robot recovers efficiently and returns to exploration as soon as possible, avoiding oscillations and repeated recovery actions.",
